 ],
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "The most dangerous word in your life isn't \"no.\"",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.813,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 8
  },
  {
   "text": "It's \"Monday.\"",
   "start": 3.478,
   "end": 4.289,
   "w0": 9,
   "w1": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone has a Monday.",
   "start": 4.888,
   "end": 6.167,
   "w0": 11,
   "w1": 14
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I'll start the diet Monday.\"",
   "start": 6.684,
   "end": 7.903,
   "w0": 15,
   "w1": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I'll quit Monday.\"",
   "start": 8.22,
   "end": 9.173,
   "w0": 20,
   "w1": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "\"New me...",
   "start": 9.582,
   "end": 10.258,
   "w0": 23,
   "w1": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "Monday.\"",
   "start": 10.582,
   "end": 11.1,
   "w0": 25,
   "w1": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the math nobody tells you.",
   "start": 11.686,
   "end": 13.252,
   "w0": 26,
   "w1": 31
  },
  {
   "text": "If you live to eighty,",
   "start": 13.627,
   "end": 14.551,
   "w0": 32,
   "w1": 36
  },
  {
   "text": "you get about four thousand Mondays.",
   "start": 14.743,
   "end": 16.829,
   "w0": 37,
   "w1": 42
  },
  {
   "text": "Total.",
   "start": 17.112,
   "end": 17.47,
   "w0": 43,
   "w1": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "At thirty,",
   "start": 18.085,
   "end": 18.939,
   "w0": 44,
   "w1": 45
  },
  {
   "text": "you've already burned over fifteen hundred of them...",
   "start": 19.244,
   "end": 22.14,
   "w0": 46,
   "w1": 53
  },
  {
   "text": "waiting for one.",
   "start": 22.844,
   "end": 23.923,
   "w0": 54,
   "w1": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "Two guys.",
   "start": 24.514,
   "end": 25.166,
   "w0": 57,
   "w1": 58
  },
  {
   "text": "Same goal.",
   "start": 25.461,
   "end": 26.116,
   "w0": 59,
   "w1": 60
  },
  {
   "text": "Same January.",
   "start": 26.35,
   "end": 27.255,
   "w0": 61,
   "w1": 62
  },
  {
   "text": "One waits for the perfect Monday.",
   "start": 27.656,
   "end": 29.424,
   "w0": 63,
   "w1": 68
  },
  {
   "text": "Clean calendar.",
   "start": 29.79,
   "end": 30.622,
   "w0": 69,
   "w1": 70
  },
  {
   "text": "New notebook.",
   "start": 30.622,
   "end": 31.455,
   "w0": 71,
   "w1": 72
  },
  {
   "text": "Perfect plan.",
   "start": 31.687,
   "end": 32.445,
   "w0": 73,
   "w1": 74
  },
  {
   "text": "The other starts on a Thursday.",
   "start": 32.924,
   "end": 34.422,
   "w0": 75,
   "w1": 80
  },
  {
   "text": "At eleven p.m.",
   "start": 34.767,
   "end": 35.862,
   "w0": 81,
   "w1": 83
  },
  {
   "text": "With ten push-ups and no plan at all.",
   "start": 35.862,
   "end": 37.832,
   "w0": 84,
   "w1": 91
  },
  {
   "text": "A year later...",
   "start": 38.305,
   "end": 39.046,
   "w0": 92,
   "w1": 94
  },
  {
   "text": "guess who's still waiting.",
   "start": 39.485,
   "end": 40.561,
   "w0": 95,
   "w1": 98
  },
  {
   "text": "Monday was never the problem.",
   "start": 41.048,
   "end": 42.688,
   "w0": 99,
   "w1": 103
  },
  {
   "text": "Monday is a hiding place.",
   "start": 42.998,
   "end": 44.585,
   "w0": 104,
   "w1": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "It lets you feel like a winner without doing anything.",
   "start": 44.86,
   "end": 47.226,
   "w0": 109,
   "w1": 118
  },
  {
   "text": "So here's the rule.",
   "start": 47.674,
   "end": 48.482,
   "w0": 119,
   "w1": 122
  },
  {
   "text": "If it matters,",
   "start": 48.828,
   "end": 49.564,
   "w0": 123,
   "w1": 125
  },
  {
   "text": "it starts today.",
   "start": 49.772,
